<title>USA: Citicorp names Alcoa president to board.</title>
<headline>Citicorp names Alcoa president to board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp said on Friday that Alain Belda, president and chief operating officer of Aluminum Co of America, was appointed to Citicorp's board of directors.</p>
<p>His election brings the Citicorp board of directors to 15 members, Citicorp said in a statement.</p>
